meta {
  name: Room status
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/device/status
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Device-Api-Key: {{deviceApiKey}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "deviceCode": "{{deviceCode}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Power-loss recovery snapshot for a room scanner.

  Returns:
  - acOn / acStatus — whether the classroom AC should be Cooling
  - teacherDisplayName — logged-in / last in-window teacher when AC is on
  - sessionActive — true if attendance time-in is still open
  - classroomId / classroomName / deviceCode / scheduleId

  ESP32 calls this after WiFi connect (and on STATUS) to restore relay + LCD.
}
